  292.45pt;mso-height-rule:exactly"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Dear <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[BPL Name]</span>,<br></span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><br>Thank
  you for coordinating the </span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[Date]</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"> blood drive.&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">The
  efforts of </span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[Account Name]</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"> have always been
  greatly appreciated and their support of the community blood program will go
  a long way toward replenishing blood supplies and ultimately saving lives.<br></span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><br></span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">The results of your blood drive are as follows:</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:
  none;tab-stops:.25in .5in .75in 1.0in 1.25in 1.5in 1.75in 2.0in 2.25in 2.5in 2.75in 3.0in 3.25in 3.5in 3.75in 4.0in 4.25in 4.5in 4.75in 5.0in 5.25in 5.5in 5.75in 6.0in 6.25in;
  mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none;mso-element:frame;mso-element-frame-width:
  450.1pt;mso-element-frame-height:328.3pt;mso-element-wrap:auto;mso-element-anchor-vertical:
  page;mso-element-anchor-horizontal:page;mso-element-left:72.05pt;mso-element-top:
  292.45pt;mso-height-rule:exactly"><ul><li><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">[#] donors registered</span></li><li><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;">[#] donors deferred</span></li><li><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;">[#] units collected</span></li><li><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;">[#] first time donors</span></li></ul></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:
  none;tab-stops:.25in .5in .75in 1.0in 1.25in 1.5in 1.75in 2.0in 2.25in 2.5in 2.75in 3.0in 3.25in 3.5in 3.75in 4.0in 4.25in 4.5in 4.75in 5.0in 5.25in 5.5in 5.75in 6.0in 6.25in;
