  page;mso-element-anchor-horizontal:page;mso-element-left:72.05pt;mso-element-top:
  292.45pt;mso-height-rule:exactly"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">In the coming days, you will receive an email with a brief satisfaction survey. We have updated our survey questions to make it a more concise and easier experience for you. Your response to the survey is essential for the Red Cross to continually evaluate your overall experience and satisfaction. </span><b style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">We want to hear from your because your voice matters!</b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:
  none;tab-stops:.25in .5in .75in 1.0in 1.25in 1.5in 1.75in 2.0in 2.25in 2.5in 2.75in 3.0in 3.25in 3.5in 3.75in 4.0in 4.25in 4.5in 4.75in 5.0in 5.25in 5.5in 5.75in 6.0in 6.25in;
  mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none;mso-element:frame;mso-element-frame-width:
  450.1pt;mso-element-frame-height:328.3pt;mso-element-wrap:auto;mso-element-anchor-vertical:
  page;mso-element-anchor-horizontal:page;mso-element-left:72.05pt;mso-element-top:
  292.45pt;mso-height-rule:exactly"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><br>Again,
  thank you for your contribution and ongoing support of this important
  community program. I look forward to working with you again on an upcoming
  blood drive.<br></span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><br>Sincerely,<br></span><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">[Account Representative Name]<br></span><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">[Contact Information]</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>]]></td>
